{"id":"msg_m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_diesel","label":"Diesel · Nikke"},"label":"8. Commander!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_01","next":"msg_m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_03","speakers":{"diesel_w":"Diesel"},"icons":{"diesel_w":"si_c075_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_1","text":"Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_2","text":"Can you hear me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_3","text":"Hear what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_4","text":"Oh my, hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_5","text":"Silly me!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_6","text":"I was going to call you, but I accidentally sent a message instead.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_7","text":"Is something wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_8","text":"Hehe! Nope,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_9","text":"nothing's wrong!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_10","text":"I just got a new microphone recently.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_11","text":"It sounds pretty good,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_12","text":"so I wanted you to hear it too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_13","text":"What's so good about it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_14","text":"First of all, your voice comes through really clearly,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_15","text":"and there's no background noise at all!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_16","text":"Soline said","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_17","text":"it makes my voice sound even better, hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_18","text":"Brid didn't believe it at first,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_19","text":"but once she heard it for herself, she couldn't help but agree.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_20","text":"Isn't that amazing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_21","text":"Yeah, that's pretty cool.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_22","text":"Does it have a voice correction feature too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_23","text":"I haven't heard of any feature like that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_24","text":"but it's such a good microphone, it might even have it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_25","text":"What do you think, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_26","text":"Would you like to hear it for yourself?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_27","text":"I was going to call you at first,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_28","text":"but I thought it'd be better if you heard it in person.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_29","text":"If you're free right now,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_30","text":"would it be okay if I came by?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_31","text":"Yeah, sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_32","text":"Thank you, Commander. Hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_33","text":"I'll be right there!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_34","text":"Oh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_35","text":"Come to think of it, there's something I haven't tried with this microphone yet!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_36","text":"I've never really sung properly with it before,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_37","text":"so while I'm there I'll sing for you too, hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_38","text":"Huh? You're gonna sing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_39","text":"Yes, hehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_40","text":"Please listen and tell me what you think.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_41","text":"I'm on my way right now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_42","text":"Wait, hang on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_43","text":"Your singing is fine...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_44","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_44","text":"... Seeing there are no more replies from her, she must already be on her way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_diesel_wintersweets_02_45","text":"I should start mentally preparing myself...","jump":null}],"chat":true}